  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Giant Sun Immortal Venerable hands Fang Yuan yin-yang path research more complete than the version once hidden in Eighty-Eight True Yang Building. Among the unorthodox small gains of that research are abortion Gu, safe pregnancy Gu, multiple pregnancy Gu, become pregnant Gu, reincarnation Gu, dead fetus Gu, and others.",
