          "gu_safe_pregnancy_gu",
          "gu_multiple_pregnancy_gu",
          "gu_become_pregnant_gu",
          "gu_dead_fetus_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Giant Sun Immortal Venerable created yin-yang path, the essence lay in Gu worms like abortion Gu, safe pregnancy Gu, and multiple pregnancy Gu. Those foundational mortal Gu sit beside the Pregnancy Temple set Fang Yuan builds from the same research line: become pregnant Gu, triplet Gu, dead fetus Gu, multiple pregnancy Gu, and safe pregnancy Gu as core human path Gu of that Immortal Gu House.",
